  "document": "¡Calexico!\n¡Calexico! True Lives of the Borderlands is a 2011 book by Doctor of Philosophy Peter Laufer. It covers Laufer's encounters and experiences during his week-long stay in Calexico, California, a city on the Mexico–California border. He asks citizens there various questions about life on the border, such as what draws them to border towns and if \"English-only\" would be a realistic policy."
